{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "ARO HCP Frontend control plane latency (S360 KPI). P50/P95/P99 from frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds. Target: P99 < 1s. Jira: ARO-28089 / ARO-28088.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "ARO-28089",
      "tooltip": "",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/ARO-28089"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### Frontend Control Plane Latency (S360)\n\n**KPI:** synchronous Frontend (RP) responses — **P99 < 1 second**.\n\n**Metric:** `frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds` (histogram; dense buckets around 1s).\n\n**Alerts:** `FrontendLatency` (1h P99>1s, Sev4/info), `FrontendPathLatency` (30m slow-fraction — >5% of requests slower than 1s, gated on >=50 req/30m and >=3 slow calls, Sev3/CI), `FrontendPathMedianLatency` (30m P50>250ms, gated on >=10 req/30m, Sev3/CI).\n\n**Excluded (matches alerts):** route `.../hcpoperationresults/{operationid}` — known slow break-glass path (route filter only; same as alert PromQL).\n\nUse this for PR evidence and day-to-day triage — not the 30-day S360 Power BI report.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Dashboard Info",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "P99 latency by method + route. S360 KPI threshold is 1s (red). Excludes hcpoperationresults (same as FrontendLatency alerts).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(\n  0.99,\n  sum by (le, route, method) (\n    rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\"}[$__rate_interval])\n  )\n)",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "P99 latency by method + route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "P95 latency by method + route. Excludes hcpoperationresults (same as FrontendLatency alerts).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(\n  0.95,\n  sum by (le, route, method) (\n    rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\"}[$__rate_interval])\n  )\n)",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "P95 latency by method + route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "P50 latency by method + route. Excludes hcpoperationresults (same as FrontendLatency alerts).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(\n  0.50,\n  sum by (le, route, method) (\n    rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\"}[$__rate_interval])\n  )\n)",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "P50 latency by method + route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Instant P50 / P95 / P99 over the selected range rate window for copy-paste triage (sort by P99). Excludes hcpoperationresults.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "P99" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 120 },
              { "id": "thresholds", "value": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] } },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "desc": true, "displayName": "P99" }]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, route, method) (rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "P50"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route, method) (rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "refId": "P95"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, route, method) (rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "P99",
          "refId": "P99"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Current latency table (P50 / P95 / P99)",
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "merge", "options": {} },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #P50": "P50",
              "Value #P95": "P95",
              "Value #P99": "P99",
              "method": "Method",
              "route": "Route"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Fraction of requests completing within 1s (le=1 / le=1.0 bucket over +Inf). Excludes hcpoperationresults.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (method, route) (rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\",le=~\"^1(\\\\.0)?$\"}[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nsum by (method, route) (rate(frontend_http_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\",le=\"+Inf\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Share of requests ≤ 1s by method + route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Request rate for context when reading latency panels. Same route exclusion as KPI latency panels.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 31 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (method, route) (\n  max without (prometheus_replica) (\n    rate(frontend_http_requests_total{cluster=\"$cluster\",route!=\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionid}/providers/microsoft.redhatopenshift/locations/{location}/hcpoperationresults/{operationid}\"}[$__rate_interval])\n  )\n)",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Request rate by method + route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["aro-hcp", "frontend", "latency", "s360", "control-plane"],
